{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>首隻在印尼出生的大熊貓「里奧」，慶祝一歲生日。</p><p></p><p>位於西爪哇省的印尼野生動物園，周五為「里奧」舉行慶祝活動，包括切蛋糕儀式等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.PANDA-2300-1_CLEAN_20261127_232937.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AgPXmIGFsl1795794351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.PANDA-2300-1_CLEAN_20261127_232937_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZdwHWEGdot1795794374.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「里奧」於去年11月27日出生，印尼總統普拉博沃為其取名「薩特里奧‧維拉塔馬」，昵稱「里奧」，意為勇敢而高貴的騎士。「里奧」的父母是旅居印尼的大熊貓「彩陶」和「湖春」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.PANDA-2300-1_CLEAN_20261127_232937_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Goc6KgQWj91795794403.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「里奧」的出生填補了印尼大熊貓人工繁育的空白，也標誌中國和印尼在大熊貓保護合作上取得重要成果。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.PANDA-2300-1_CLEAN_20261127_232937_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263OrCeWNNZx1795794418.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:09.888920+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:12:27.732732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:16.828065+00:00","content_hash":"1091f697c4412510ad56ae2b3fd31a16956401b81884bf3816180586d271dd05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:09.888920+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}